		<summary><![CDATA[Hello, and welcome the the Midnight Mercenaries steam group. We're a group consisting of gamers, artists, coders and much more. We currently own 2 Divisions right now. We have a Division in Mount &amp; Musket, a modification for Mount &amp; Blade: Warband. We also have a division in Battlegrounds 2, A modification for Half-Life 2. If you're interested in joining go to <a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.midnightmercs.enjin.com%21" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >www.midnightmercs.enjin.com!</a><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.midnightmercs.enjin.com" target="_blank" rel=" noopener" >Midnight Mercenaries Website</a><span class="bb_link_host">[www.midnightmercs.enjin.com]</span><br><a class="bb_link" href="http://steamcommunity.com/groups/2ndColdstream" target="_blank" rel="" >2nd Coldstream Regiment of Footguards (Napoleonic Wars Division)</a>]]></summary>
